      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.5",
        "Four-shot live-action scene in the supplied location. Images 1–5 are overlapping directions of ONE continuous environment. Preserve its layout, architecture, vehicles, props, plants and lighting across shots. Image 6 is Character A and image 7 is Character B. Match these two identities and their wardrobe; each reference sheet represents ONE person. The two people face each other on fixed marks in the location.\n\nSHOT 1, 0–3 seconds: wide two-person establishing shot. Start with both characters visible. Track sideways and pan to hold them near the middle while revealing the environment.\nSHOT 2, 3–5 seconds: cut to three-quarter behind Character A, over their shoulder onto Character B's face. Show the corresponding location behind Character B.\nSHOT 3, 5–7 seconds: cut to the reverse three-quarter behind Character B, over their shoulder onto Character A's face. Show the correct opposite direction of the same environment.\nSHOT 4, 7–10 seconds: cut to a wide two-shot. In one continuous move, arc across their dialogue axis, then pan and widen to reveal more of the environment while keeping both people clearly visible through the final frame.\n\nExactly four shots and three cuts. Keep the two performers on fixed marks and preserve the location through each cut. Full-frame cinematic realism, natural movement, rigid architecture and stationary props. Silent footage, clean frame.",
        "720p",
        "16:9",
        10,
        false,
        "reference",
        "mp4",
        true,
        false,
        1742454472,
        "randomize",
        false
      ],
